msgid "Every payment method of the shop"
msgstr "Tutti i metodi di pagamento del negozio"

#. module: om_pos_access
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_om_pos_access
msgid ""
"Restrict what each cashier may do in the Point of Sale: refunds, discounts, "
"prices, cash, closing, customers, payment methods"
msgstr ""
"Limita ciò che ogni cassiere può fare nel Punto vendita: rimborsi, sconti, "
"prezzi, contanti, chiusura, clienti, metodi di pagamento"

#. module: om_pos_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access.field_om_pos_access_rules__om_pos_max_price_cut
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access.field_res_users__om_pos_max_price_cut
msgid ""
"How far below the price of the pricelist a price may be set. 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Quanto sotto il prezzo del listino può essere impostato un prezzo. 0 per "
"nessun limite."

#. module: om_pos_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_om_pos_access__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_om_pos_access_rules__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_pos_config__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_pos_order__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_pos_session__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_res_partner__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_res_users__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: om_pos_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access.field_om_pos_access_rules__om_pos_payment_method_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_pos_access.field_res_users__om_pos_payment_method_ids
msgid ""
"Leave empty to allow every payment method of the shop. Set, only these are "
"shown and may be used, and orders paid otherwise are refused."
msgstr ""
"Lascia vuoto per consentire tutti i metodi di pagamento del negozio. Se "
"impostato, vengono mostrati e possono essere usati solo questi, e gli ordini"
" pagati diversamente vengono rifiutati."

#. module: om_pos_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_om_pos_access_rules__om_pos_max_discount
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_res_users__om_pos_max_discount
msgid "Maximum Discount (%)"
msgstr "Sconto massimo (%)"

#. module: om_pos_access
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_om_pos_access_rules__om_pos_max_price_cut
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_pos_access.field_res_users__om_pos_max_price_cut
msgid "Maximum Price Cut (%)"
msgstr "Ribasso massimo di prezzo (%)"

